    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      523.01,
      397.2,
      600.83
    ],
    "text": "4.(1) The affairs of the body corporate shall, subject tothe other provisions of this Act and the rules in force for thetime being of the body corporate be administered by aCommittee of Management consisting of Chairman,Secretary, Treasurer another two members elected inaccordance with such rules.",
    "fonts": [
