    "text": "7.All debts and liabilities of the body corporate on theday preceding the date of commencement of this Act, shallbe paid and discharge by the body corporate herebyconstituted and all debts due to, subscriptions andcontributions payable to the body corporate on that dayshall be paid to the body corporate for the purposes of thisAct.",
